WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.680 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

02:30.500 --> 02:33.090
<i>You don't want to die?</i>

02:41.640 --> 02:43.140
<i>Who are you?</i>

02:43.140 --> 02:45.430
I heard your voice.<i></i>

02:45.430 --> 02:47.350
You said you didn't want to die.<i></i>

02:48.060 --> 02:49.690
Why?<i></i>

02:49.690 --> 02:53.650
<i>They would be sad...my Mom and Dad.</i>

02:54.400 --> 02:59.650
Parents that never came to visit you or be here at your moment of death?

02:59.650 --> 03:01.660
<i>Still, I...</i>

03:01.660 --> 03:04.700
If you still want to live,

03:04.700 --> 03:09.290
I will give you a strong and beautiful heart in exchange for your soul.

03:09.290 --> 03:10.920
<i>A strong heart?</i>

03:11.330 --> 03:15.290
Of course, I don't mind you giving me your soul after you die.

03:15.290 --> 03:22.140
Whether you die now, or live out a fulfilled life with a new heart, is your decision.

03:23.430 --> 03:26.100
<i>I...want to live!</i>

03:26.600 --> 03:29.810
I understand. However, don't forget!

03:29.810 --> 03:32.730
Your new heart is from that of the Demon World.

03:32.730 --> 03:35.900
If you forget our agreement...

03:35.900 --> 03:42.860
...and fill your soul with the love that Demons despise, your heart will stop beating.

03:42.860 --> 03:46.280
In acquiring knowledge, humans were banished from paradise.

03:46.280 --> 03:49.750
By learning about love, humans became confused and suffered.

03:49.750 --> 03:53.170
You are better off without love.

03:56.380 --> 03:58.300
His heart beat is coming back!

03:58.300 --> 04:00.630
Yes! Now he will be saved!

04:03.180 --> 04:07.640
A Boy with a Demon's Heart

04:11.430 --> 04:13.600
This is the last straw...!

04:16.860 --> 04:18.230
My, Chiaki-san!

04:18.230 --> 04:19.860
I won't forgive him!

04:22.280 --> 04:23.990
Damn my old man!

04:25.360 --> 04:28.790
I thought you just got a divorce, and you're going to have another arranged marriage?!

04:28.790 --> 04:30.500
Hey, Chiaki!

04:30.500 --> 04:32.160
WELCOME!

04:32.160 --> 04:33.540
Huh?

04:33.540 --> 04:37.960
Chiaki-kun actually came to visit me. That makes me so happy!

04:37.960 --> 04:38.960
Cut the crap!

04:38.960 --> 04:40.630
What the heck is everyone doing?!

04:40.630 --> 04:43.090
Do you know what kind of guy this is?!

04:43.090 --> 04:46.180
He's about to have his 56th arranged marriage!

04:46.180 --> 04:48.600
That's why we've been trying to find a match.

04:48.600 --> 04:50.260
Type A!

04:50.260 --> 04:51.930
Type B!

04:51.930 --> 04:54.480
And, Type C!

04:54.480 --> 04:57.100
NOW, WHICH ONE WOULD YOU CHOOSE?

05:00.440 --> 05:01.730
Chiaki!

05:06.740 --> 05:08.530
Wait up, Chiaki!

05:08.530 --> 05:10.540
He was thinking about you!

05:14.290 --> 05:15.960
About me?

05:15.960 --> 05:20.340
Then what about the feelings of the other person? What about his own feelings?

05:27.680 --> 05:29.050
Hey, Kagura.

05:29.050 --> 05:31.260
Yes, Kaiki-sama?

05:31.260 --> 05:32.810
People are so dumb...

05:32.810 --> 05:34.180
Huh?

05:34.180 --> 05:38.900
They don't quite realize when their child has outgrown them.

05:39.690 --> 05:41.190
Kaiki-sama...

05:41.190 --> 05:43.860
Will you reject them for me?

05:45.650 --> 05:47.150
I refuse.

05:47.150 --> 05:48.030
Huh?

05:48.450 --> 05:52.160
Reject them yourself. It's not my problem.

05:53.290 --> 05:55.120
Kagura, you're mean.

05:55.750 --> 05:56.750
Sorry...

05:56.750 --> 05:59.130
We weren't thinking...

05:59.130 --> 06:00.130
I'm sorry.

06:00.130 --> 06:03.250
- No...

06:00.630 --> 06:03.250
- This is not the place to argue.

06:04.300 --> 06:05.880
Hijiri-sensei.

06:05.880 --> 06:10.050
I've come to visit a friend of mine, but he doesn't seem to be in this room.

06:10.050 --> 06:14.640
I'm sorry, but could you deliver these flowers to him?

06:14.640 --> 06:16.730
Huh? Me?

06:16.730 --> 06:18.190
Please.

06:23.230 --> 06:25.530
Such a tedious plan.

06:25.530 --> 06:32.330
Can you really weaken Jeanne and break God's barrier from the inside like that?

06:32.330 --> 06:34.950
I have my own way of doing things.

06:34.950 --> 06:40.460
- Well, under certain circumstances, I wouldn't mind giving you a hand.

06:38.330 --> 06:40.460
- Jeanne is my prey!

06:42.630 --> 06:44.630
Stay out of this...

06:46.300 --> 06:48.970
F-Fine.

06:51.760 --> 06:55.890
- Shikaido-sensei brought marigold flowers...

06:55.890 --> 06:56.720
Huh?

06:56.720 --> 06:59.060
What's wrong with marigold flowers?

06:59.060 --> 07:01.650
The meaning of the flower isn't very good.

07:01.650 --> 07:03.440
It means "sadness of departure."

07:03.440 --> 07:06.780
Shikaido-sensei probably didn't know since he is a man.

07:06.780 --> 07:09.860
What should I do? Would not delivering this be better?

07:09.860 --> 07:14.160
Don't worry about it. I'd be happy with anything I got.

07:14.780 --> 07:17.290
Oh, we're here.

07:18.160 --> 07:21.000
Let's see... Hmm...

07:21.000 --> 07:22.880
What was his name again?

07:22.880 --> 07:25.040
Takazuchiya Zen-kun.

07:25.960 --> 07:27.340
Be quiet!

07:27.340 --> 07:30.550
I suggest you don't make a sound...

07:32.130 --> 07:33.840
- Huh? Where's Kusakabe-san?

07:33.840 --> 07:35.810
- Maybe she went to the bathroom.

07:36.390 --> 07:38.100
I think I lost them.

07:38.100 --> 07:43.100
I'll let you go once I'm out of the hospital, so cooperate until then.

07:43.100 --> 07:49.990
I know it's not my place to say this, but you shouldn't deliver these marigolds.

07:49.990 --> 07:53.450
You're a girl, and you don't know what the meaning of these flowers is?

07:53.450 --> 07:55.450
Talk about absurd.

07:55.450 --> 07:58.790
Why don't you try to be more like a girl and learn a couple--

08:05.040 --> 08:06.880
Excuse me!

08:09.260 --> 08:12.260
Damn it! I'll remember this!

08:12.260 --> 08:14.390
That was a sick patient?

08:14.390 --> 08:17.140
He seemed stronger than average, both in body and voice.

08:18.060 --> 08:20.220
He is Takazuchiya Zen-kun.

08:20.930 --> 08:24.850
Please forgive him, Kusakabe-san.

08:24.850 --> 08:26.610
He has a few issues to resolve...

08:26.610 --> 08:29.360
It's okay. I'm fine.

08:31.190 --> 08:33.570
So that was Takazuchiya Zen-kun...

08:34.200 --> 08:39.160
Tell me, Kagura! What is he in for?! What kind of guy is he?!

08:39.160 --> 08:43.710
The hospital can't reveal a patient's personal data.

08:43.710 --> 08:46.000
You should know that.

08:46.540 --> 08:53.050
But if you're going to talk to Zen-kun, I can tell you some things.

08:53.050 --> 08:54.090
Why me?!

08:54.760 --> 08:59.850
Because he's all alone. Even his parents don't visit him.

08:59.850 --> 09:01.060
What?

09:01.060 --> 09:06.480
He's been hospitalized for 5 years with a very serious heart disease.

09:06.480 --> 09:10.650
He made remarkable progress as time went on.

09:10.650 --> 09:16.360
All he needs to do now is to get strong enough to endure the surgery...

09:16.360 --> 09:17.740
And his parents...?!

09:17.740 --> 09:19.780
Why won't they visit him?!

09:19.780 --> 09:21.240
I don't know...

09:21.240 --> 09:24.500
I assume they have their reasons.

09:24.500 --> 09:29.290
But even if they did have their reasons...

09:29.290 --> 09:31.800
Whatever the reason...

09:31.800 --> 09:34.510
Right now is the most important time.

09:34.510 --> 09:38.430
However, the nurses are worried about him because he insists on overdoing things...

09:42.260 --> 09:43.850
For 5 years...

09:43.850 --> 09:48.350
After that long, I don't blame him for being cranky.

09:48.350 --> 09:52.610
You idiot. Using his hospitalization and disease as excuses is for losers.

09:52.610 --> 09:54.610
It's all up to the individual.

09:54.610 --> 09:55.690
But...

09:56.740 --> 09:59.280
I wonder why his parents don't come visit him?

09:59.280 --> 10:00.830
What kind of reasons could there be?

10:00.830 --> 10:03.330
They're busy with their own lives.

10:04.200 --> 10:09.540
It was in a certain novel: "You are more important than your child."

10:09.540 --> 10:11.750
This is how all parents think.

10:11.750 --> 10:13.090
That can't be...

10:13.710 --> 10:17.840
Like my father, who just got a divorce, and then goes off to have an arranged marriage...

10:17.840 --> 10:20.340
Like your parents, who haven't sent a letter in ten years...

10:20.340 --> 10:23.850
...and just call on the phone to say that they're getting a divorce...

10:24.470 --> 10:27.180
<i>Maron-chan. This is Mom.</i>

10:27.180 --> 10:31.230
<i>Because of certain issues, your father and I have decided to divorce.</i>

10:31.230 --> 10:38.490
<i>We don't know who will take care of you yet, but your life will be the same as always. Well, then...</i>

10:39.490 --> 10:43.740
What...are those issues?

11:02.050 --> 11:05.560
Ah, Zen-kun's mother... Zen-kun is inside--

11:10.350 --> 11:12.060
That was Zen-kun's...?

11:12.060 --> 11:14.440
She should go visit him.

11:14.440 --> 11:16.980
She goes up to the door every day.

11:16.980 --> 11:18.190
Every day?

11:18.190 --> 11:22.530
Yes. She prays in front of the door, then leaves...

11:22.530 --> 11:23.820
Prays?

11:23.820 --> 11:25.030
Is Zen-kun inside?

11:25.030 --> 11:28.580
Yes, if he hasn't tried to escape like every day.

11:39.510 --> 11:41.930
He's cute when he's asleep.

11:41.930 --> 11:43.640
Yeah, really.

11:43.640 --> 11:46.180
I'm going to leave before he wakes up.

11:46.180 --> 11:48.720
Don't tire him too much.

11:48.720 --> 11:49.730
Okay.

11:56.570 --> 11:58.360
Who are you?

11:58.360 --> 12:00.650
Um, I, uh...

12:00.650 --> 12:02.660
Oh, you're that violent girl.

12:03.240 --> 12:06.530
That was your fault! After all, you suddenly pulled me into the elevator--

12:06.530 --> 12:10.620
This place is for authorized personnel only,

12:10.620 --> 12:12.250
Violent Girl-san.

12:12.250 --> 12:16.500
I'm sorry, but I have a name: Kusakabe Maron.

12:16.500 --> 12:17.380
Maron?

12:17.380 --> 12:18.340
Yes.

12:18.340 --> 12:19.710
Weird name.

12:20.380 --> 12:23.880
Well, excuse me for not having a cool name like you!

12:23.880 --> 12:26.430
I never asked for it!

12:32.850 --> 12:34.730
Do you like airplanes?

12:36.060 --> 12:38.270
I used to like them.

12:39.150 --> 12:43.740
With this body, being able to fly is just another dream.

12:43.740 --> 12:46.160
No, you'll get better.

12:46.160 --> 12:49.830
What are you?! How can you say that so easily?!

12:50.410 --> 12:54.330
Will you leave? I don't want to see anybody.

12:54.330 --> 12:56.710
Even your parents?

12:56.710 --> 12:59.040
What are you talking about?

12:59.040 --> 13:02.550
Your mother was just here.

13:02.550 --> 13:05.430
Hmph, no use in lying.

13:05.430 --> 13:07.050
It's not a lie!

13:07.050 --> 13:12.140
She left right away, though... Is there something between you and your parents?

13:12.140 --> 13:13.680
Nope. Nothing.

13:13.680 --> 13:14.690
That's not true.

13:14.690 --> 13:19.230
Families are just individuals who are blood-related.

13:19.230 --> 13:21.530
I don't care and neither do they.

13:21.530 --> 13:25.150
No! There are no parents who don't love their children!

13:26.490 --> 13:27.910
There shouldn't be...

13:27.910 --> 13:30.950
Shouldn't be? You can't say for sure.

13:30.950 --> 13:32.450
I...

13:32.450 --> 13:33.660
...believe in them.

13:33.660 --> 13:35.330
Believe, huh?

13:36.290 --> 13:38.250
You haven't even made sure!

13:38.250 --> 13:40.790
Have you?

13:40.790 --> 13:42.000
Well...

13:42.000 --> 13:47.840
I see. You're the one that wants to believe in your parents' love.

13:48.640 --> 13:51.010
I do want to believe...

13:51.010 --> 13:53.640
At least for now, I want to believe.

13:53.640 --> 13:59.440
I don't know how many times I've thought: "If only I could fly across the ocean..."

13:59.440 --> 14:01.020
Fly across the ocean...

14:01.020 --> 14:02.730
But look at you!

14:02.730 --> 14:07.740
The only thing between you and your mother is that door!

14:07.740 --> 14:11.530
You can meet her any time you want, if you'd just turn that knob!

14:11.530 --> 14:14.500
So why is it that you deny her?!

14:14.500 --> 14:17.210
Why do you reject her? Why do you not believe in her?!

14:17.210 --> 14:19.460
You really want to see her, don't you?!

14:19.460 --> 14:23.130
You can't help but wanting to see her! So, why?!

14:23.130 --> 14:24.170
Shut up!

14:24.170 --> 14:25.630
Get out of here!

14:25.630 --> 14:27.170
Don't ever come back again!

14:32.140 --> 14:33.510
Me, too...

14:38.600 --> 14:39.730
Mom...

14:44.860 --> 14:47.400
<i>However, don't forget!</i>

14:47.400 --> 14:54.790
<i>If you forget our agreement and fill your soul with the love that Demons despise...</i>

14:54.790 --> 14:59.120
...your heart will stop beating.

14:59.500 --> 15:02.790
So, Zen-kun said all that.

15:02.790 --> 15:05.710
I got so distraught...

15:05.710 --> 15:11.050
Zen-kun could be right. Families sometimes are strangers to each other.

15:11.050 --> 15:13.510
Do you believe that, too?!

15:14.600 --> 15:19.440
Since you believe you should be close, you don't know what to do once you're apart.

15:19.440 --> 15:22.730
It's like you're trying to see where they are with your back turned.

15:22.730 --> 15:26.940
But that's not a good reason for not wanting to see them.

15:26.940 --> 15:28.940
Yeah, you're right.

15:28.940 --> 15:31.280
I'm so full of regret.

15:31.280 --> 15:34.580
I keep asking myself: "Why? Wasn't there something I could have done?"

15:34.580 --> 15:37.410
You're such a good girl, Maron-chan.

15:37.410 --> 15:41.580
Maybe Zen-kun will open up to you.

15:41.580 --> 15:46.840
Because you can empathize with another person's pain as if it was yours.

15:48.300 --> 15:50.630
Zen-kun, it's time for your check-up...

15:51.880 --> 15:53.720
Gone again! Geez!

16:00.060 --> 16:01.190
Zen-kun...

16:13.450 --> 16:15.660
Onii-chan, thank you!

16:17.580 --> 16:19.240
You're welcome.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.920
What's the matter, Onii-chan?

16:28.050 --> 16:29.340
Could it be?!<i></i>

16:37.430 --> 16:39.850
A Demon possessed Zen-kun...

16:39.850 --> 16:43.850
Why? He's been doing better.

16:43.850 --> 16:46.730
And he has a serious illness!

16:49.230 --> 16:50.820
I won't forgive them!

16:51.490 --> 16:53.530
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

16:53.530 --> 16:56.160
<i>- Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc...!</i>

16:54.530 --> 16:56.160
- Not yet.

16:57.280 --> 16:59.240
Hijiri-sensei!

16:59.240 --> 17:00.990
Not yet.

17:00.990 --> 17:04.210
Isn't it a bit too early for thieves?

17:10.250 --> 17:15.630
So in other words, Kaitou Jeanne steals in order to save God from the Devil.

17:15.630 --> 17:18.300
You knew my identity and yet you didn't say anything.

17:18.300 --> 17:24.940
Oh, my. I never said I knew, or didn't know, your identity.

17:24.940 --> 17:26.560
Well, yeah...

17:26.560 --> 17:30.730
However, it's true there was something that pulled me towards you.

17:30.730 --> 17:31.480
To me?

17:31.480 --> 17:34.650
To you and your surroundings.

17:34.650 --> 17:37.200
Then, you and Zen-kun are...

17:37.200 --> 17:39.280
Complete strangers.

17:39.280 --> 17:41.790
He doesn't know anything about me.

17:41.790 --> 17:43.250
Why, then?

17:43.250 --> 17:45.910
"Spirit Sense," as some might call it.

17:45.910 --> 17:48.750
It's always fascinated me.

17:48.750 --> 17:54.050
When I was walking in front of the hospital, his room seemed like it had a dark shadow cast upon it.

17:54.050 --> 17:56.170
Why did you give me the flowers?

17:56.170 --> 18:02.680
Because I thought you could handle it. And I was right.

18:02.680 --> 18:06.850
You have a beautiful light surrounding you.

18:06.850 --> 18:12.940
I won't stop you. Nor will I reveal your identity. Therefore...

18:12.940 --> 18:18.240
...will you let me help you? I want you to use my powers.

18:18.240 --> 18:19.110
But...

18:19.110 --> 18:22.740
I can't leave you alone. I want to help you.

18:23.450 --> 18:25.910
I want to protect you.

18:34.500 --> 18:36.010
Please.

18:39.890 --> 18:41.260
Get your hands off Maron!

18:41.260 --> 18:42.220
Chiaki!

18:42.220 --> 18:45.850
What did you intend to do after pulling your student's face closer, Sensei?

18:45.850 --> 18:48.440
What are you talking about?!

18:48.440 --> 18:53.860
Thank you for bringing her home. Leave the rest to me.

18:53.860 --> 18:56.530
Chiaki, watch what you say!

18:57.150 --> 18:59.780
I guess I'll be leaving now.

19:01.820 --> 19:03.280
But Nagoya-kun...

19:04.080 --> 19:06.580
I think you should stop, too.

19:06.580 --> 19:09.830
Playing around at night is dangerous.

19:12.460 --> 19:13.710
<i>He knows...</i>

19:15.130 --> 19:17.260
<i>He knows my identity.</i>

19:21.050 --> 19:22.930
I hate you today!

19:24.510 --> 19:26.470
What should I do...?

19:28.980 --> 19:30.060
Fin...

19:30.060 --> 19:32.850
I'll definitely save Zen-kun.

19:34.650 --> 19:36.360
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

19:36.360 --> 19:38.690
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

20:00.260 --> 20:02.430
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

20:02.430 --> 20:04.640
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

20:04.640 --> 20:06.350
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

20:12.980 --> 20:16.730
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

20:46.050 --> 20:47.430
Angel...

20:48.350 --> 20:51.180
A dream... Is it a dream?

20:54.690 --> 20:57.060
No, it's not a dream!

20:58.110 --> 21:00.780
If it's not a dream, then please!

21:00.780 --> 21:02.400
Let me fly!

21:03.450 --> 21:04.860
Zen-kun.

21:04.990 --> 21:07.660
Oh, you're not...

21:07.660 --> 21:10.040
I see. You're...!

21:10.040 --> 21:11.500
Wait!

21:11.500 --> 21:12.830
Zen-kun!

21:14.830 --> 21:15.710
Zen-kun!

21:15.710 --> 21:18.000
Don't come near me, you Demon!

21:19.290 --> 21:23.170
Don't take me away...

21:23.170 --> 21:27.890
I haven't come to take you away! I've come to save you!

21:27.890 --> 21:31.220
No, I don't want to go...

21:31.220 --> 21:33.060
I'm on your side!

21:33.060 --> 21:35.310
- Are you sure?

21:36.060 --> 21:37.350
Who are you?!

21:42.900 --> 21:45.900
I am the Demon Knight, Noin.

21:45.900 --> 21:47.200
Noin...

21:47.200 --> 21:51.490
Jeanne, that boy doesn't have much longer to live.

21:51.490 --> 21:56.580
However, his life is being prolonged by the Demon that's possessing him.

21:56.580 --> 22:00.960
In other words, he will die if you seal the Demon.

22:00.960 --> 22:02.050
That's a lie!

22:09.010 --> 22:12.600
Whether you believe it or not is up to you.

22:13.430 --> 22:14.890
So, Jeanne...

22:14.890 --> 22:23.440
Will you still <i>Checkmate?</i>

22:28.660 --> 22:35.290
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.040 --> 22:44.710
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.300 --> 22:49.220
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.220 --> 22:52.890
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.100 --> 23:02.020
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.610 --> 23:05.780
Never forgetting...

23:06.070 --> 23:09.900
...there is unending love.

23:10.610 --> 23:14.660
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.830 --> 23:17.950
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.200 --> 23:21.170
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.620 --> 23:26.090
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.300 --> 23:30.180
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.380 --> 23:37.970
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.980 --> 23:51.030
Please, Jeanne! Steal my heart!

23:51.030 --> 23:53.240
No! If I do...

23:53.240 --> 23:58.830
I can't handle it! Living a lie isn't living at all!

23:58.830 --> 23:59.540
But...!

23:59.540 --> 24:02.830
Please! In order to live on my own...

24:02.830 --> 24:05.210
I beg of you, Maron!

24:05.210 --> 24:09.460
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne:  Decision?! Checkmate of Sorrow

24:09.460 --> 24:12.430
Don't worry. I have an Angel with me.

24:12.430 --> 24:14.510
An excellent one!
